        },
        {
          "id": 48,
          "start": 158.25,
          "end": 161.853,
          "en": "deleteContact sounds like a fitting method names to me.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 49,
          "start": 163.59,
          "end": 168.59,
          "en": "So now in App.vue, I'll add this deleteContact method",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 50,
          "start": 169.21,
          "end": 172.07999999999998,
          "en": "and in here, I now want to remove that contact",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 51,
          "start": 172.07999999999998,
          "end": 173.6,
          "en": "from my array.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 52,
          "start": 173.6,
          "end": 174.873,
          "en": "Now what's missing here?",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 53,
          "start": 176.45,
          "end": 179.62,
          "en": "Well, some identification criteria, right?",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 54,
          "start": 179.62,
          "end": 182.95,
          "en": "We need to know which contact should be deleted.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 55,
          "start": 182.95,
          "end": 185.803,
          "en": "So just as before for toggling the Favoritestatus,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 56,
          "start": 186.66,
          "end": 189.51,
          "en": "it would be good to get the idea of the friend",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 57,
          "start": 189.51,
          "end": 191.17,
          "en": "that should be deleted.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 58,
          "start": 191.17,
          "end": 193.38,
          "en": "And therefore all the justice before,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 59,
          "start": 193.38,
          "end": 195.83,
          "en": "we can go to FriendContact.vue,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 60,
          "start": 195.83,
          "end": 199.02,
          "en": "and pass this as a second argument to emit,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 61,
          "start": 199.02,
          "end": 203.393,
          "en": "and forward the id Prop, which we are getting here,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 62,
          "start": 204.66,
          "end": 207.793,
          "en": "so refer to that here and pass it with delete.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 63,
          "start": 209.75,
          "end": 213.92000000000002,
          "en": "So now in App.vue, here in deleteContact,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 64,
          "start": 213.92000000000002,
          "end": 216.35,
          "en": "we now want to find the friend with that id",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 65,
          "start": 216.35,
          "end": 218.053,
          "en": "and delete him or her.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 66,
          "start": 218.96,
          "end": 221.82999999999998,
          "en": "And an elegant way of doing that in JavaScript",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 67,
          "start": 221.82999999999998,
          "end": 224.61,
          "en": "when you have an array and you want to delete an array",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 68,
          "start": 224.61,
          "end": 226.97,
          "en": "based on some information you have about the item",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 69,
          "start": 226.97,
          "end": 230.94,
          "en": "that should be removed is you can overwrite the array",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 70,
          "start": 230.94,
          "end": 233.38,
          "en": "and assign a new value to this property",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 71,
          "start": 233.38,
          "end": 234.82999999999998,
          "en": "that stores the array.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 72,
          "start": 234.82999999999998,
          "end": 236.98,
          "en": "So the friends property in this case,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 73,
          "start": 236.98,
          "end": 240.98,
          "en": "and use the old array but called the filter method on it.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 74,
          "start": 240.98,
          "end": 245.3,
          "en": "Filter is a method that's built into JavaScript,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 75,
          "start": 245.3,
          "end": 248.86,
          "en": "which will return a new array based on the array",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 76,
          "start": 248.86,
          "end": 250.66,
          "en": "on which you're calling it.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 77,
          "start": 250.66,
          "end": 253.59,
          "en": "And it will return the array on which you are calling it,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 78,
          "start": 253.59,
          "end": 257.1,
          "en": "except for the elements you are filtering out.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 79,
          "start": 257.1,
          "end": 259.41,
          "en": "For that filter wants a function,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 80,
          "start": 259.41,
          "end": 261.29,
          "en": "which you provide as an argument,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 81,
          "start": 261.29,
          "end": 263.76,
          "en": "and if that function returns true,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 82,
          "start": 263.76,
          "end": 265.53,
          "en": "an element is kept around,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 83,
          "start": 265.53,
          "end": 267.46,
          "en": "if that function returns false,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 84,
          "start": 267.46,
          "end": 269.56,
          "en": "the element is deleted.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 85,
          "start": 269.56,
          "end": 273.35,
          "en": "It's a function which will receive the element as an input,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 86,
          "start": 273.35,
          "end": 276.12,
          "en": "automatically by JavaScript, so this will run",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 87,
          "start": 276.12,
          "end": 278.9,
          "en": "for every friend in friends and JavaScript",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 88,
          "start": 278.9,
          "end": 281.86,
          "en": "will feed in every friend step by step.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 89,
          "start": 281.86,
          "end": 284.37,
          "en": "And we should return true if you wanna keep the item",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 90,
          "start": 284.37,
          "end": 287.99,
          "en": "or false otherwise and this arrow function syntax",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 91,
          "start": 287.99,
          "end": 291.28,
          "en": "is just a different way of writing a function in JavaScript,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 92,
          "start": 291.28,
          "end": 295.59000000000003,
          "en": "by the way, and here, I can therefore now check",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 93,
          "start": 295.59000000000003,
          "end": 298.406,
          "en": "if the friend.id is not equal",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 94,
          "start": 298.406,
          "end": 300.453,
          "en": "to the friendId I'm getting here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 95,
          "start": 301.84,
          "end": 306.08,
          "en": "I'm checking for non-equality, because if it is equal,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 96,
          "start": 306.08,
          "end": 307.53,
          "en": "I want to keep it.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 97,
          "start": 307.53,
          "end": 309.47,
          "en": "So in checking for non equality,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 98,
          "start": 309.47,
          "end": 314.29,
          "en": "I ensure that if the ids are equal, I return false,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 99,
          "start": 314.29,
          "end": 317.623,
          "en": "because if they are equal, I want to remove that friend.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 100,
          "start": 318.81,
          "end": 321.2,
          "en": "And I mentioned that items are dropped",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 101,
          "start": 321.2,
          "end": 324.43,
          "en": "if we return false here, so I wanna return false",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 102,
          "start": 324.43,
          "end": 326.003,
          "en": "if we find a matching id.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 103,
          "start": 327.52,
          "end": 330.18,
          "en": "With that, we generate a brand new friends array,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 104,
          "start": 330.18,
          "end": 333.77,
          "en": "which is the old array minus the friend with this Id",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 105,
          "start": 333.77,
          "end": 337.76,
          "en": "and then we store that back into our friends data property,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 106,
          "start": 337.76,
          "end": 340.63,
          "en": "Vue will then detect this change in friends,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 107,
          "start": 340.63,
          "end": 344.43,
          "en": "it will see that friends changed, it will rerender that list",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 108,
          "start": 344.43,
          "end": 346.803,
          "en": "and update the UI appropriately.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 109,
          "start": 348.40999999999997,
          "end": 349.923,
          "en": "So if we now save that,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 110,
          "start": 351.11,
          "end": 354.64,
          "en": "and I click on Delete here on Manuel,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 111,
          "start": 354.64,
          "end": 356.48,
          "en": "you'll see Manuel is gone",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 112,
          "start": 356.48,
          "end": 358.52,
          "en": "and of course, we can also delete Julie.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 113,
          "start": 358.52,
          "end": 360.57,
          "en": "If we reload the data as back,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 114,
          "start": 360.57,
          "end": 361.92,
          "en": "because all of that is of course,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 115,
          "start": 361.92,
          "end": 365.31,
          "en": "just happening in JavaScript and therefore in memory.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 116,
          "start": 365.31,
          "end": 367.84,
          "en": "But later, we will also see how we can send",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 117,
          "start": 367.84,
          "end": 370.85,
          "en": "such data to a server and store it permanently",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 118,
          "start": 370.85,
          "end": 372.69,
          "en": "on a server site database.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 119,
          "start": 372.69,
          "end": 375.8,
          "en": "But for the moment, this is a huge step forward,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 120,
          "start": 375.8,
          "end": 379.15,
          "en": "because it shows us what we can do with components",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 121,
          "start": 379.15,
